#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Available options for building with Qiskit Runtime primitives"
msgstr "Pilihan yang tersedia untuk membina dengan primitif Qiskit Runtime"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to options"
msgstr "Pengenalan kepada pilihan"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to options {#introduction-to-options}"
msgstr "Pengenalan kepada pilihan {#introduction-to-options}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
" You can use options to customize Qiskit Runtime primitives to meet your "
"needs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh menggunakan pilihan untuk menyesuaikan primitif Qiskit Runtime "
"mengikut keperluan anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"options-structure\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"options-structure\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Structure {#structure}"
msgstr "Struktur {#structure}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When calling the primitives, you can pass in options by using an options "
"class or a dictionary. Commonly-used options, such as `resilience_level`, "
"are at the first level. Other options are grouped into categories, such as "
"`execution`. Specify the options in this format:  `options.option.sub-"
"option.sub-sub-option = choice`.  For example: "
"`options.dynamical_decoupling.enable = True`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Apabila memanggil primitif, anda boleh menghantar pilihan menggunakan kelas "
"pilihan atau kamus. Pilihan yang kerap digunakan, seperti "
"`resilience_level`, berada di peringkat pertama. Pilihan lain dikumpulkan ke"
" dalam kategori, seperti `execution`. Tentukan pilihan dalam format ini: "
"`options.option.sub-option.sub-sub-option = choice`. Sebagai contoh: "
"`options.dynamical_decoupling.enable = True`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"options-defaults\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"options-defaults\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Defaults {#defaults}"
msgstr "Nilai lalai {#defaults}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you do not specify a value for an option, it is given a special value of "
"`Unset` and the server default value is used. Thus, the default value will "
"be the same regardless of your code version.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika anda tidak menentukan nilai untuk sesuatu pilihan, ia akan diberikan "
"nilai khas `Unset` dan nilai lalai pelayan akan digunakan. Oleh itu, nilai "
"lalai akan sama tanpa mengira versi kod anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The tables in the \"Options classes summary\" section on each primitive's "
"\"options\" guide lists the default values.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jadual dalam bahagian \"Ringkasan kelas pilihan\" pada setiap panduan "
"\"options\" primitif menyenaraikan nilai lalai.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"options-precedence\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"options-precedence\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Set options {#set-options}"
msgstr "Tetapkan pilihan {#set-options}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Options can be defined before a primitive is constructed and passed to the "
"primitive as an instance of the options class or a dictionary.  The "
"primitive makes a copy of them, which means that changing the original "
"dictionary or options instance doesn't affect the options that the primitive"
" owns. \n"
msgstr ""
"Pilihan boleh ditakrifkan sebelum primitif dibina dan dihantar kepada "
"primitif sebagai satu instance kelas pilihan atau kamus. Primitif membuat "
"salinannya, yang bermaksud bahawa mengubah kamus asal atau instance pilihan "
"tidak menjejaskan pilihan yang dimiliki oleh primitif.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Additionally, you can change the options after the primitive is constructed."
" Use the workflow that works best for your application. \n"
msgstr ""
"Selain itu, anda boleh mengubah pilihan selepas primitif dibina. Gunakan "
"aliran kerja yang paling sesuai untuk aplikasi anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes about specifying primitive options\">\n"
"- You can see the available options during or after primitive initialization.\n"
"- If you do not specify a value for an option, it is given a special value of `Unset` and the server defaults are used.\n"
"- The `options` attribute is the `dataclass` Python type.  You can use the built-in `asdict` method to convert it to a dictionary.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Nota tentang menentukan pilihan primitif\">\n"
"- Anda boleh melihat pilihan yang tersedia semasa atau selepas pemulaan primitif.\n"
"- Jika anda tidak menentukan nilai untuk sesuatu pilihan, ia akan diberikan nilai khas `Unset` dan nilai lalai pelayan akan digunakan.\n"
"- Atribut `options` adalah jenis Python `dataclass`. Anda boleh menggunakan kaedah terbina `asdict` untuk menukarkannya kepada kamus.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`options` class {#options-class}"
msgstr "kelas `options` {#options-class}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When creating an instance of the primitive class, you can pass in an "
"instance of the `options` class. Those options are then applied when you use"
" `run()` to perform the calculation.  Specify the options in this format:  "
"`options.option.sub-option.sub-sub-option = choice`.  For example: "
"`options.dynamical_decoupling.enable = True`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Apabila mencipta satu instance kelas primitif, anda boleh menghantar masuk "
"satu instance kelas `options`. Pilihan tersebut kemudiannya digunakan "
"apabila anda menggunakan `run()` untuk melakukan pengiraan. Tentukan pilihan"
" dalam format ini: `options.option.sub-option.sub-sub-option = choice`. "
"Sebagai contoh: `options.dynamical_decoupling.enable = True`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See [`SamplerOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/options-sampler-options) or "
"[`EstimatorOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/options-estimator-options) for full details about the class.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lihat [`SamplerOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/options-sampler-options) atau "
"[`EstimatorOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/options-estimator-options) untuk butiran penuh tentang kelas "
"tersebut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following example uses the Estimator primitive, but the syntax for other"
" primitives is similar.\n"
msgstr ""
"Contoh berikut menggunakan primitif Estimator, tetapi sintaks untuk primitif"
" lain adalah serupa.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Dictionary {#dictionary}"
msgstr "Kamus {#dictionary}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "You can specify options as a dictionary when initializing a primitive.\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh menentukan pilihan sebagai kamus apabila memulakan primitif.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"update-options\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"update-options\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Update options after initialization {#update-options-after-initialization}"
msgstr ""
"Kemas kini pilihan selepas pemulaan {#update-options-after-initialization}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can specify the options in this format: `_primitive_.options.option.sub-"
"option.sub-sub-option = choice` to take advantage of auto-complete, or use "
"the `update()` method to make bulk updates.\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh menentukan pilihan dalam format ini: "
"`_primitive_.options.option.sub-option.sub-sub-option = choice` untuk "
"memanfaatkan auto-lengkap, atau gunakan kaedah `update()` untuk membuat "
"kemas kini secara pukal.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The primitive's options class "
"([`EstimatorOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/options-estimator-options) or "
"[`SamplerOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/options-sampler-options)) does not need to be instantiated if you "
"are setting options after initializing the primitive.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kelas pilihan primitif "
"([`EstimatorOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/options-estimator-options) atau "
"[`SamplerOptions`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/options-sampler-options)) tidak perlu di-instantiate jika anda "
"menetapkan pilihan selepas memulakan primitif.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

